WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.500
<b>Osho High School</b>

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.710
<b> April 6</b>

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.920
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.920
<b>Urushi Yaotome</b>

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.920
<b>Ayumu Tanaka</b>

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.920
<b>Takeru Kakuryu</b>

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.290
Good morning, Senpai.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:55.630
Ayumu.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:58.130
What's up? You're here awfully early.

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:03.460
Knowing you, I thought you might come visit
the club room before the opening ceremonies.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.750
Oh, okay.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.080
I get to play shogi here for another year.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.630
So, Ayumu. You're a second-year now.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.790
Yes. And you're a third-year.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.380
Have you checked the class assignments yet?

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:26.750
No, not yet.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:28.130
Neither have I.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.210
You want to go together?

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:31.670
Yes, Senpai.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:41.040
It's kind of exciting when
they change all the classes, huh?

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.630
It certainly is.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:54.330
<b>Class 2-1</b>

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:54.330
<b>Class 2-2</b>

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:54.330
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.580
Hey, it's Ayumu and Senpai!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.210
What's up!

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:00.790
Good morning to you.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:03.290
So you've already seen your assignments, right?

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.500
What do you think?

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:07.330
I just don't know what I'm gonna do.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.290
I'm in the same class as Sakurako again.

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.170
That's good news.

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:19.170
Y-yeah, it is.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.040
I'm happy for you, Sakurako-chan.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:26.710
Is there anyone you want to be
in the same class with, Senpai?

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.670
Y-yeah.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.380
There is.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.710
Oh... I see.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.040
The third-year assignments are over there!

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:46.290
Ayumu, the second-year classes are right here.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:47.540
Yeah.

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.250
<b>Class 2-1</b>

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.250
<b>Class 2-2</b>

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.250
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.880
I didn't know Senpai felt that way about anyone.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:00.000
What class are you in?

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:04.250
Class 1. What about you?

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:06.920
I got the same class!

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:12.040
So she's in the same class as
the person she mentioned earlier.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.960
You look really happy.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.960
W-was it that obvious?

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:21.580
Yes.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.540
So what?

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.880
Aren't you happy about it, Ayumu?

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.080
What?

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.080
You know...

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.710
We're in the same class.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.290
You and me.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:43.080
We're in different years, but since we're both in Class 1,
we can be on the same team on Sports Day again.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.380
That does make me happy.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.000
Oh, good!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.670
I hope I get to carry you in the scavenger race again.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.960
No! It's too embarrassing!

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:03.580
Now, let's take one step forward

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:07.000
Let me feel your heartbeat

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:10.250
Tactics require a poker face

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:15.290
Because I don't want my opponent to realize

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.790
For distance, a few centimeters

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.920
Take the long way

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:25.460
Aiming for a smile

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:28.830
A secret strategy

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.040
An airtight defense

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.250
Just a little more

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:41.670
I'll meet you halfway, so look the other way

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:45.670
I get scared of being hurt

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.880
There are nights like that

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.380
A chance that comes from crossed signals

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:56.670
I won't let it escape me. I'll turn the tables

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.330
Now, let's take one step forward

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.500
Write your own story

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:12.130
The opening sentence always starts with "actually," "I always"

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.710
The twist is in progressive tense

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.040
Let me feel your heartbeat

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.500
Tactics require a poker face

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.750
Because I don't want my opponent to realize

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.290
Hey, long time no see!

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:36.960
<b>Game 7: I Can't Just Quit, Senpai</b>

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.630
Uuu-ruu-shi!

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.630
We're together again!

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:43.960
Happy new school year!

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:44.790
Yeah!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.420
Oh! Maki! Uru!

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:50.830
Yay! We get to be together for our last year!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.130
Miku-chan, Hinano!

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.000
Hm?

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.250
What happened? That was a weird scream.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.670
Aha, so your shoulders are your weak spot!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.290
No, they're not! She just tickled me a little!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.000
What fun!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.210
Me, too!

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:10.960
What is happening?

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:19.250
N-no, stop it!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:21.630
Sorry, sorry.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.710
Aahh, that was fun.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:30.210
Hey, I know. You want to go to
the new crepe place on the way home?

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.290
I'm in! Matcha crepe, here I come!

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.080
I had my eye on their tuna ham crepe,
and their blueberry cream cheese!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.710
You mean business!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.080
What about you, Urushi?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.710
If you order the special matcha, you can share it with me!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.710
Oh, but I...

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.210
Oh, I know. Urushi's going to the Tanaka place.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.460
Tanaka place?

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:52.670
What's that?

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:53.960
What kind of food do they have?

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.540
Well, I can tell you it's much sweeter than crepes!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.540
It's not sweet at all! It's just club! We're playing shogi!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.540
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.540
<b>Urushi Yaotome</b>

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.540
<b>Ayumu Tanaka</b>

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.540
<b>Takeru Kakuryu</b>

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.040
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.040
<b>3x3 Puzzle</b>

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.040
<b>Come to the Shogi Club room if you're interested!</b>

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.040
We have fliers...

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.750
<b>Club Application</b>

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.750
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.750
<b>I humbly request to join the aforementioned club.</b>

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.750
And club applications.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.750
If we get fifty copies...

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.380
No, let's go with a hundred!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.380
You're really enthusiastic.

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:16.880
Darn right I am!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.790
We have to really fight to recruit members tomorrow!

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:21.130
Right!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.330
Let's give it our all!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.250
Yeah!

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:42.210
It's been a whole year now.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.380
Yo, Ayumu! Hurry it up!

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.080
<b>KENDO TEAM</b>

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.080
<b>NEW MEMBERS WANTED!!</b>

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:04.130
It's not like it's first-come first-served.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.130
There's no need to rush.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.040
Yeah, I know, but...

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.330
I'm just so hyped.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:11.710
Hyped?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.460
As of today, we're officially high school students!

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:18.500
And I hear this place has a really good kendo team.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.000
You won't be beating me anymore.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.790
High school students...

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:25.080
I can get a part-time job.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.290
I was thinking, to help me build strength,
I could deliver milk.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:36.040
You never change. You just don't get excited.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.500
You think so?

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.630
But, hey, we only just started here.

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:44.880
Anything could happen to you. For instance...

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.960
You could fall in love.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.000
You know?

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:50.830
Love?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.750
Look, it doesn't have to make sense now.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.710
When it happens, it'll hit you like lightning.

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:58.790
Lightning?

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:03.040
So you're saying you felt like
you got hit by lightning with Sakurako?

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.000
Wha--

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:08.830
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:08.830
<b>3x3 Puzzle</b>

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:08.830
<b>Come to the Shogi Club room</b>

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:08.830
<b>if you're interested!</b>

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:15.000
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:15.000
<b>3x3 Puzzle</b>

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.210
A flier?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:18.540
Sorry about that!

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:22.540
I forgot to put a weight on the fliers,
and the wind blew them all away!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.540
Are you new here?

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:46.290
Yes.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.540
Well, I'm from the shogi club.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:56.000
And that flier...  Um, that's a tsume shogi on it.
It's a kind of puzzle.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.460
So if you like...

00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.750
So this is...

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.290
Yes! That's a tsume shogi!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.630
Does this mean you're interested!?

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.250
This is what it meant!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.080
Are you interested!?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.380
Hey. If you want, we could play a game.
Do you want to play a game of shogi?

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:19.210
I just know you'll love it if you give it a try!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.130
Uh, yeah, sorry.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.790
We already decided to join the kendo team.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.080
Huh? Oh, uh, really?

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.250
Yo, let's go, Ayumu.

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.080
I will join your club.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.540
Huh?

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:11.500
<b>Shogi</b>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:11.500
<b>Club</b>

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:10.670
There!

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:14.130
Now we're all ready for tomorrow!

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:17.460
I hope we get new club members.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:19.580
Let's show them how much fun shogi can be!

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.330
That's the idea.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.040
You wouldn't know the joy of shogi if not for me, after all.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:26.080
That's right!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.000
It hit me like lightning!

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.040
Did it now! That's good to hear!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.500
Yes, indeed.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:36.460
I hope other people feel the lightning, too. Just like you.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.420
Just like me?

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.330
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.330
<b>Club Application</b>

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:43.290
I'm not so sure we want that...

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.330
Why not!?

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:52.080
<b>New Student</b>

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:52.080
<b>Club Fair</b>

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:52.500
<b>Osho High School</b>

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:54.830
<b>New Student</b>

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:54.830
<b>Club Fair</b>

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:54.830
<b>Osho High School</b>

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.000
Hey, you there! Got any interest in volleyball?

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:01.960
No, I'm sorry. I already know what club I'm going to join.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:09.420
I'm on my way, Senpais.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:23.210
<b>Shogi</b>

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:23.210
<b>Club</b>

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.250
Okay!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.000
Today we recruit new members! Let's do this!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.080
Yeah!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:29.040
Alright, we're off to hand out fliers.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:30.670
I'm counting on you!

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.080
Senpai!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:37.130
I'll recruit everybody I can, and
make the shogi club an official school club!

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:40.420
Yeah! And I'll be here, doing what I can, too!

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.290
It's hopeless.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.080
Completely hopeless.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.380
I forgot the paper weight again!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.380
Here you are.

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:59.580
Uh, thank you.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.210
She's so pretty...

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:05.880
Um, may I ask you for directions, please?

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.040
Uh, sure. Where do you want to go?

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:10.580
I'm looking for the kendo--

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:11.420
We're back!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:14.880
I handed out all my fliers, but...

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:18.250
I didn't get any very promising reactions, either.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.250
Oh, okay.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.000
Thanks anyway. Good work.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:26.830
Senpais!

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.380
It's good to see you again!

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.380
I am glad to see that you are both doing quite well!

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.460
Those manners that are better
than any manners need to be...

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:35.330
You're...

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:36.920
Yes!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.290
It is I!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.000
You know each other?

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.000
She went to our middle school.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.540
This is our club president.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:45.920
Nice to meet you!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:49.670
My senpais' club president?

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.330
That means...

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:58.500
I see. Then I have already arrived at my destination.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.750
I am Rin Kagawa. It's a pleasure
to make your acquaintance.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.460
I'm Urushi Yaotome.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.000
I hope we can be friends.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.880
So? What are you doing here, Rin?

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:12.710
I had lost my way, but it's alright now.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:15.290
Okay...?

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.210
And this is the application to join your club, yes?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.130
I hope I may use your pen.

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:22.920
What!? You're going to join our club!?

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.000
<b>Class: 1-2</b>

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.000
<b>Name: Rin Kagawa</b>

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:24.540
Of course!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.460
Seriously?

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:30.210
Senpais, I look forward to joining you once more!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.170
Yeah!

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.460
This is great, Senpai.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:34.420
Yeah!

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:37.460
So we don't have to recruit anymore, right?

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.670
No, no, of course you do.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:42.580
Come on.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.330
Seriously.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.710
But I did not expect this.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:49.290
I thought you were all about kendo.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.830
Is this... not the kendo team?

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.500
<b>Shogi</b>

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.500
<b>Club</b>

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:07.040
But... I thought... you two were on the kendo team?

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.250
Now I'm in the shogi club.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:11.460
I never joined the kendo team, either.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.880
Urushi Yaotome-san... was it?

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.170
Uh, yes...

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.710
I humbly request that you return my Senpais to me.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.420
You mean Ayumu and Takeru?

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.540
Return them to you?

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:30.880
Yes.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.710
Tanaka-senpai, I challenge you to a duel.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:41.960
If I win, you will quit the shogi club,
and return to the kendo team.

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.420
Here I was so happy to get a new club member...

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.380
But she's taking my club members away!?

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:50.580
Please.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.750
Yeah, once she's said something,
she refuses to back down.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:14.790
Senpai.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:17.790
Do you mind if I step away for a bit?

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.630
I can't ignore a sincere request
from my former teammate.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.420
Uh, okay.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:26.540
Thank you very much.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:32.080
The way this went, I couldn't have said no if I wanted to.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.170
Now, please show me to the dojo.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:37.210
This way.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.880
A-Ayumu!

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:46.750
Don't worry. I'm going to win.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:50.250
Okay.

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:06.080
Senpai was so good, they called him
the Immovable Tanaka, unshakable as a mountain.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.880
He poured his whole soul into kendo.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:11.130
I've always had so much respect for him.

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:14.460
So why?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.420
At least take a flier! If you don't mind!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:44.040
If you're interested, come on and join the shogi club!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:56.500
It's gonna be fine. He's going to win.
I mean, he's never lost.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:58.000
Yeah...

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.420
But I'm still worried.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.670
Well, Rin is pretty good, too...

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.040
And Ayumu hasn't fought in a year!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.250
That's why we have to do all
we can to recruit new members!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.040
So we can still have a club even if he leaves.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.710
Ayumu told me all about it.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:20.290
Your wish is to get more members
and make this club official.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:23.290
Yeah, it is, but...

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.960
That is my wish, but...

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.580
Takeru! Can you take care of things here?

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.330
Sure...

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:59.460
It was my dream to get more members
and have an official club.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:08.080
But even if I do get to have a club...

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.830
Ayumu, I...

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.830
If you're not a part of it, I...

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.080
It's not what I want!

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:26.420
Ayumu!

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.250
Senpai.

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:39.790
Ayumu...

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.250
I'm sorry.

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:53.420
I mean, I didn't want to worry you.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.170
And it interrupted our club recruitment.

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:01.710
I won the duel.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:25.460
In the end, we didn't get a single new member.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.130
I'm sorry.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.830
Oh, no, it's not your fault.

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.330
And there's still tomorrow.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:36.130
Yes! And I will work one hundred times harder tomorrow!

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:39.630
And I'll shout a thousand times louder!

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:43.040
No, actually, maybe you should be a little quieter.

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:45.920
You scared people today, remember?

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:50.420
I believe it's not his volume,
but Kakuryu-senpai's face that scares people off.

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:52.750
That is blatantly rude.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:56.040
And what are you still doing here anyway?

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.000
The kendo team is that way!

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.830
Wait, do you not know how to get there?

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:05.290
Here, I'll show you...

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:06.210
No need.

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:09.540
I am a member of the shogi club.

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:12.710
Why?

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:18.750
Why else? I lost the duel.

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:35.330
<b>Shogi</b>

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:35.330
<b>Club</b>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:37.000
Is that how it works?

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.040
Yes.

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:05.080
The term "next to" is surprisingly versatile

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:12.040
For example, you can be one meter apart
from someone and still be "next to" them

00:23:12.380 --> 00:23:20.130
We're in a stale-mate, in a town dyed rosy red

00:23:20.130 --> 00:23:29.040
I want to know your real feelings, but you evade and keep walking

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:38.580
Then I realize we're within 50 centimeters (doo-wop x2)

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:46.290
Or am I outside of 50 centimeters? (doo-wop x2)

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:53.750
What is the reason we walk home together? (doo-wop x2)

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:58.000
Unable to ask, our shadows align
